.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt CMP 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm cmp
.Nd compare two files byte by byte
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl l | Fl s
.Ar file1 file2
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility compares two files.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl l
Print every differing byte as an offset and two octal values.
.It Fl s
Suppress output and report only the exit status.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
0 when the files are identical, 1 when they differ, 2 for usage or an I/O error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr diff 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
